        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Bilkul! Ye phenomenon hai DISPERSION - jab white light prism (ya water droplet) se pass karti hai toh wo apne constituent colors (VIBGYOR) mein split ho jati hai. White light actually 7 colors ka mixture hai!"
