      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Rainbow formation mein teen processes hain: (1) REFRACTION jab sunlight water droplet mein enter karti hai - dispersion hota hai. (2) INTERNAL REFLECTION droplet ke back surface pe. (3) Fir se REFRACTION jab light droplet se exit karti hai. Violet sabse neeche, Red sabse upar dikhta hai observer ko!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Matlab rainbow bhi TIR use karta hai?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Haan! Internal reflection! Rainbow hamesha Sun ke opposite direction mein dikhta hai. Aur agar double rainbow dikhe (rare), toh secondary rainbow mein color order REVERSE hota hai - Red inside, Violet outside! ⭐ BPSC/UPSC Explanation Favorite!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Aur scattering kya hoti hai Sir?"
