          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Scattering - jab light particles/molecules se takrati hai toh har direction mein scatter ho jati hai. RAYLEIGH SCATTERING - jab particle size wavelength se bahut chhota ho. Blue light scatters MOST (short wavelength), Red scatters LEAST. Isliye sky BLUE dikhta hai (blue light har taraf scatter hoti hai)!"
